cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this artifact, please cite the paper below."
title: "PixGuard-Sim: A Deadline-Aware Testbed for Pix Fraud Detectors"
abstract: >-
  An open testbed that scores a Pix fraud detector against the 1.5 s authorization
  budget the Brazilian regulator gives a paying institution, from the latency the
  detector actually measures, and releases a Pix-native generator with a settlement
  clock and two scenarios open data omits: multi-hop MED-2.0 refund tracing and
  payment under coercion.
type: software
license: MIT
